      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear how painful and final it feels when words and help can't seem to undo the loss you face. It is a completely normal human desire to feel close to someone you love deeply, but I am  very concerned because you mentioned wanting to end your life to \"go to where they are.\"\nPlease know that suicide only leaves you alone in the quiet, even if you feel like you would be together.\nI encourage you to call 988 or 1 800 273 825 any time you feel this urge; I can help connect you to someone who just wants to reach a calm place for the you without trying to \"fix\" the pain for you",
